    "body": "As we support internationalization, we should make sure all our prompts templates are in i18n lino files, and we should have separate ./locales/prompts/system folder, for everything that is specific to prompts that get passed to system prompt for our tools like codex/claude and others.\r\n\r\n./locales/prompts/ - for all prompts in which are not system prompts\r\n\r\n./locales for everything else.\r\n\r\nIf https://github.com/link-foundation/lino-i18n does not fully support merging of i18n lino files in such structure we must report issue there and do temporary workaround here.\r\n\r\nAlso note that I updated https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3837 about bulk drafting.",
